  "rules": [
   "decision at the 18:00 NY daily roll (yesterday's close_time); entry = first M1 open of the new trading day",
   "draw selection: trend by previous-day extremes: yesterday's high > the day-before's high and yesterday's low >= its low -> long toward PDH (mirror); otherwise no draw",
   "target = the nominated previous-day extreme, stop = the opposite one (draw reached first = win); a gap beyond either level drops the day",
   "hold: one session (1376 M1 bars); days with < 600 M1 bars are not read"
  ],
